{
  "uid": "perfops-blokus-proxy",
  "title": "PerfOps Blokus — Proxy Layer (Nginx)",
  "description": "Nginx connections (stub_status), access log requests and latency, and error log patterns (Loki).",
  "tags": [
    "blokus",
    "proxy",
    "nginx",
    "perfops"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "loki",
        "label": "Loki",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "loki",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "Nginx exporter",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(nginx_up, instance)",
          "refId": "instance"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(nginx_up, instance)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 2
      },
      {
        "name": "max_worker_connections",
        "label": "worker_connections limit",
        "description": "worker_processes x worker_connections from nginx.conf. Set to 0 to hide the limit line.",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "1024",
        "hide": 2,
        "current": {
          "text": "1024",
          "value": "1024"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "1024",
            "value": "1024"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "OS dashboard (USE)",
      "url": "/d/perfops-blokus-use",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Application dashboard",
      "url": "/d/perfops-blokus-app",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "SLI / SLO dashboard",
      "url": "/d/perfops-blokus-slo",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "NGINX CONNECTIONS (stub_status)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Connection limits"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Active connections vs worker_connections**\n\n- Close to the limit (red dashed line): Nginx itself is about to become the bottleneck. Every WebSocket keeps a connection open, so compare with the Node.js connections line.\n- Far below the limit: connection capacity is not a constraint.\n\n*Each proxied connection uses two slots (client and upstream), so the limit line is worker_connections ÷ 2.*\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 4,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Dropped connections**\n\n- Above 0: Nginx accepted a connection but could not handle it, which means worker_connections or the descriptor limit was reached. Confirm in the error log section.\n- 0: every accepted connection was handled.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Active connections vs limit",
      "description": "Client connections held by Nginx, compared with Node.js WebSocket connections",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "nginx_connections_active{instance=~\"$instance\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} nginx active",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(blokus_active_ws_connections)",
          "legendFormat": "Node.js WebSocket connections",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "vector($max_worker_connections / 2) > 0",
          "legendFormat": "Max client connections (worker_connections ÷ 2)",
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "Max.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Dropped connections per second",
      "description": "Accepted minus handled connections",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(nginx_connections_accepted{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]) - rate(nginx_connections_handled{instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} dropped/s",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: /s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.01
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 7,
      "title": "REQUESTS (access log, Loki)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 8,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Status classes"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 9,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Request rate by status class**\n\n- 5xx rising: a backend or proxy failure. Check the error log: 502 means the backend is down, 504 means it is too slow.\n- 4xx rising: mostly client mistakes (wrong codes, bad passwords), which are excluded from the SLIs. A sudden jump can mean a client bug or a scan.\n- Only 2xx: the server side is healthy.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 10,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**5xx by status code**\n\n- 502: the backend is down or refusing connections.\n- 504: the backend is too slow (upstream timed out).\n- 503: rate limiting or no live upstreams.\n- Nothing: no server-side failures.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Requests per second by status class",
      "description": "Server-side throughput and errors (WebSocket upgrades, status 101, are not counted)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${loki}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate({job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status =~ \"2..\" [$__auto]))",
          "legendFormat": "2xx",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate({job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status =~ \"3..\" [$__auto]))",
          "legendFormat": "3xx",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate({job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status =~ \"4..\" [$__auto]))",
          "legendFormat": "4xx",
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate({job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status =~ \"5..\" [$__auto]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx",
          "refId": "D",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "2xx"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "3xx"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "4xx"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "5xx"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 12,
      "title": "5xx per second by status code",
      "description": "Which server errors are happening",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${loki}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 29
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status)(rate({job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status =~ \"5..\" [$__auto]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 13,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Latency: Nginx vs backend"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 14,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**$request_time vs $upstream_response_time**\n\n- Both high and close together: the backend is the cause. Go to the application layer (event loop lag, GC).\n- $request_time high but $upstream_response_time low: the delay is in Nginx or the network (slow clients, queueing), not in the backend.\n- Both low but client latency high: the delay is outside the server (player network, browser), which is where RUM data helps.\n\n*WebSocket upgrades (status 101) are excluded, because their $request_time is the whole session length.*\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 15,
      "title": "$request_time p50 / p95 / p99",
      "description": "Total time spent in Nginx per request",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${loki}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.5, {job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status != \"101\" | unwrap request_time | __error__=\"\" [$__auto]) by (job)",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, {job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status != \"101\" | unwrap request_time | __error__=\"\" [$__auto]) by (job)",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.99, {job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status != \"101\" | unwrap request_time | __error__=\"\" [$__auto]) by (job)",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 16,
      "title": "$upstream_response_time p50 / p95 / p99",
      "description": "Time spent in the backend per request",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${loki}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 46
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.5, {job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status != \"101\" | unwrap upstream_response_time | __error__=\"\" [$__auto]) by (job)",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, {job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status != \"101\" | unwrap upstream_response_time | __error__=\"\" [$__auto]) by (job)",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.99, {job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status != \"101\" | unwrap upstream_response_time | __error__=\"\" [$__auto]) by (job)",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 17,
      "title": "p95: Nginx vs backend",
      "description": "If the two lines are close, the backend is the cause",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${loki}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 55
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, {job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status != \"101\" | unwrap request_time | __error__=\"\" [$__auto]) by (job)",
          "legendFormat": "$request_time p95",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${loki}"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, {job=\"nginx\", log_type=\"access\"} | json | status != \"101\" | unwrap upstream_response_time | __error__=\"\" [$__auto]) by (job)",
          "legendFormat": "$upstream_response_time p95",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 18,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 64
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Backend distribution"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 19,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 66
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**$upstream_addr**\n\n- Uneven distribution: a load balancing problem (weights, sticky sessions, one instance slower).\n- Even distribution: balancing is healthy.\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 20,
      "title": "Requests per second by backend",
      "description": "Which Node.js instance served the requests",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${loki}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
